<title>USA: First Financial buys back 1.2 mln shares.</title>
<headline>First Financial buys back 1.2 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>STEVENS POINT, Wis. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Financial Corp said Thursday that as of the end of the first quarter it had repurchased 1.2 million shares at an average cost of $24.30 per share under a program to buy back five percent of its stock, or nearly 1.9 million shares.</p>
<p>The company announced the program during the 1996 fourth quarter.</p>
<p>First Financial was up 1/8 at 25-1/2.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
